    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the complete tool in [output/main.py](/workspace/output/main.py).\n\nWhat it does:\n- Parses `--input` and `--output` flags.\n- Reads input as bytes for accurate `characters` counting.\n- Computes `lines` exactly per spec (`\\n`-terminated line logic, including no-trailing-newline case).\n- Splits words using only the spec whitespace set: space, `\\t`, `\\n`, `\\r`, `\\f`, `\\v`.\n- Counts words case-insensitively (`lower()`), computes unique words, and returns top 10.\n- Sorts `top_words` by:\n1. descending `count`\n2. ascending lexicographic `word` for ties.\n- Writes JSON in the required schema.\n- Exit codes:\n1. `0` success\n2. `1` invalid invocation or input file missing/unreadable/malformed (including UTF-8 decode failure)\n3. `2` unexpected internal error\n\nValidation run:\n- Confirmed success path and JSON output.\n- Confirmed `--extra` unknown arg returns exit code `1`.\n- Confirmed missing input file returns exit code `1`.\n- Confirmed edge cases like `hello` (no newline) and `\\n\\n\\n` line counting.",
